# WatchParty Environment Configuration

# Supabase Public API Credentials (Optional for local testing, required for cross-device cloud sync)
# Obtain these from your Supabase Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Note: If VITE_SUPABASE_URL or VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are omitted or left as placeholders,
# WatchParty automatically runs in Local Multi-Tab Realtime mode using high-speed BroadcastChannel,
# allowing zero-config instant multi-tab synchronized playback testing right out of the box!
